# Pairs with BulkHintBound. The old leaf's read position passes a foreign record
# of its range when it is allocated, without applying it - a live advance of the
# old leaf that is not honest about foreign records. The cap then trusts a read
# position the old leaf does not hold up to.
MODULE: BulkHintBoundForeignPassedUnapplied
TARGET: BulkHintBound
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the old leaf's read position passes a foreign record without applying it
PERTURBS: ForeignAlloc

--- FIND
    /\ Alloc("f")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<rowsO, rpO, fO, narrowed,
--- REPLACE
    /\ Alloc("f")
\* MUTATION: the old leaf's read position passes the record unapplied.
    /\ rpO' = IF narrowed THEN rpO ELSE next
    /\ UNCHANGED <<rowsO, fO, narrowed,
--- END